        "The purchasing platform trusted by independent dentists.",
        "Fireside has delivered meaningful savings across our practice while making purchasing dramatically easier for our team.",
        "Oak Mountain Pediatric",
        "This platform has saved me so much time and many headaches! No more going to different websites to find the best price.",
        "White Oak Pediatric Dentistry",
        "They are amazing people with a sound mission to support independent dental practices. Excellent, relevant CE.",
        "Holly Tree Pediatric Dentistry",
        "There’s no transparency.",
        "You've been told you're getting the \"best price\" but you don't have a way to compare to make sure you're getting a fair deal.",
        "Private practices pay more.",
